*** Settings ***
Documentation       Unmodified STM32CubeU5 HAL (v1.9.0 components: stm32u5xx-hal-driver v1.6.3,
...                 cmsis-device-u5 v1.4.3, cmsis-core v5.9.0_20250520) configures a 160 MHz system
...                 clock from MSIS and PLL1 as generated by STM32CubeMX
...                 (firmware-tests/stm32cube/clock, ST start-up code and linker script).
Resource            ${CURDIR}/../common/stm32u575.resource
Test Setup          Run HAL Clock Firmware

*** Variables ***
${ELF}              ${ROOT}/build/firmware/hal-clock.elf
${STEP_DONE}        7
# Renode warnings for accesses to registers, fields or addresses without a model.
${UNMODELLED_ACCESS}    Unhandled (read|write)|non existing peripheral

*** Keywords ***
Run HAL Clock Firmware
    Create STM32U575 Machine
    Create Log Tester               0
    Execute Command                 $bin=@${ELF}
    Execute Command                 macro reset "sysbus LoadELF $bin"
    Execute Command                 runMacro $reset
    Execute Command                 emulation RunFor "0.1"

Read Symbol
    [Arguments]                     ${symbol}
    ${address}=                     Execute Command    sysbus GetSymbolAddress "${symbol}"
    ${address}=                     Strip String       ${address}
    ${value}=                       Read Word          ${address}
    RETURN                          ${value}

Symbol Should Be
    [Arguments]                     ${symbol}    ${expected}
    ${value}=                       Read Symbol        ${symbol}
    Should Be Equal As Integers     ${value}           ${expected}    msg=${symbol} = ${value}    values=False

*** Test Cases ***
Should Complete The HAL Clock Configuration
    Symbol Should Be                failedStep         0
    Symbol Should Be                halStatus          0
    Symbol Should Be                step               ${STEP_DONE}

Should Report 160 MHz Through The HAL
    FOR    ${symbol}    IN    sysclkHz    hclkHz    pclk1Hz    pclk2Hz    pclk3Hz    systemCoreClockHz
        Symbol Should Be            ${symbol}          160000000
    END
    Property Should Be              rcc SystemClockFrequency    160000000

Should Keep HAL Time At 1 kHz
    [Documentation]                 HAL_Delay(10) waits 11 ticks (HAL adds one tick); the tick then
    ...                             advances by 100 per 100 ms of virtual time.
    ${before}=                      Read Symbol        tickBeforeDelay
    ${after}=                       Read Symbol        tickAfterDelay
    ${delay}=                       Evaluate           ${after} - ${before}
    Should Be Equal As Integers     ${delay}           11
    ${address}=                     Execute Command    sysbus GetSymbolAddress "uwTick"
    ${address}=                     Strip String       ${address}
    ${first}=                       Read Word          ${address}
    Execute Command                 emulation RunFor "0.1"
    ${second}=                      Read Word          ${address}
    ${ticks}=                       Evaluate           ${second} - ${first}
    Should Be Equal As Integers     ${ticks}           100

Should Not Touch Unmodelled Registers
    Should Not Be In Log            ${UNMODELLED_ACCESS}    treatAsRegex=true
